			<ukm:Supersedes URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/sdsi/2023/9780111057247"><dc:title xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">The Climate Change (Scotland) Act 2009 (Interim Target) Amendment Regulations 2023</dc:title><ukm:DocumentMainType Value="ScottishDraftStatutoryInstrument"/><ukm:Year Value="2023"/><ukm:ISBN Value="9780111057247"/></ukm:Supersedes>
			
			<category term="CLIMATE CHANGE"/>
			<summary>These Regulations amend the Climate Change (Scotland) Act 2009 (“the 2009 Act”). Section 2(1) of the 2009 Act (the interim targets) imposes a duty on the Scottish Ministers to ensure that the net Scottish emissions accounts for the years 2020, 2030 and 2040 are, respectively, at least 56%, 75% and 90% lower than the baseline (as defined by section 11(1) of the 2009 Act).</summary>
